            <lg xml:id="m-dbdf997c-1793-4533-9f78-14e6fbbc6937">
              <l xml:id="m-f179aafd-8d3d-4232-b791-bdd726bed851" facs="#m-eb80994f-d2b5-48ed-a1be-905797f5aa80" label="ambiguous">1425</l><l xml:id="m-71272ea2-84a2-4033-85bc-07d8e9c165e2" facs="#m-b934d254-a5e5-4cb7-877d-6303c245cf6a" label="ambiguous">April 2.</l><l xml:id="m-a66994da-0473-4164-bebc-75cfb87a1f08" facs="#m-aec95ab0-ccc3-400a-8475-de1e33c1f54e" label="lyrics-like">V. Ora pro nóbis Virgo dolorosíssima.</l><l xml:id="m-b5556515-730b-4e37-a437-009739e5446c" facs="#m-c2a83aac-f71f-4b0e-b531-6e1354f49c62" label="lyrics-like">R. Ut digni efficiámur promissiónibus Christi.</l><l xml:id="m-69401e2d-b195-4e01-9165-69e057c4da3b" facs="#m-6bc5925a-8c99-4a65-8da3-e519bd43cf75" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-62824d8b-4b83-460d-852d-cd26b30c56c6" facs="#m-fe303b83-5897-4a3c-b5bb-3314b5e46788" label="ambiguous">Ant. 8.G</l><l xml:id="m-2fabf3af-cdf3-488c-be7a-d9187e32bd3c" facs="#m-8bf24ace-ab5d-495e-91e2-9b7780713edd" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-9e2a85c1-6945-488a-8b43-5e9d327c44ca" facs="#m-4d564ddf-2ccf-4690-934a-9c6e80cd7fd7" label="lyrics-like">UM vidísset Jé-sus “Mátrem stántem juxta</l><l xml:id="m-e1b28674-02d4-4b8c-bf40-6340c7b92f25" facs="#m-01648a0c-dad2-4b80-af38-b395c3561f75" label="lyrics-like">crú-cem, et discípu-lum quem di-ligébat, dí-cit Mátri</l><l xml:id="m-16ae08ae-4093-4e66-b247-5bddfc3887b5" facs="#m-02738830-4225-45b2-bc32-ff23ca8bd128" label="lyrics-like">sú-ae: Mú-li-er ecce fí-li-us tú-us. De- inde dí-cit di¬</l><l xml:id="m-3e0dea35-e0ec-4fd6-925d-26b8ad25b0d7" facs="#m-035ea94d-66b7-4fe2-9180-9b16c17b1b0d" label="lyrics-like">scípu-lo : Ecce má-ter tú-a. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-98e97cc5-cd54-4417-989b-69682fddc756" facs="#m-21480615-cebe-43e4-a2ca-1d6f33a04a55" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 8. G. p. 212.</l><l xml:id="m-0604b5d8-73ab-45ce-9d56-46233e45e3d3" facs="#m-537d20a6-242b-4c28-a764-13ddc489185a" label="lyrics-like">Prayer. Deus in cujus passióne. p. 1422.</l><l xml:id="m-dceab140-b5ec-482d-92de-4acd5b4e2fc2" facs="#m-f15b6482-dbd8-4d64-bcaf-3a2a4edc1055" label="ambiguous">~~ ~ ~~   = = = = =~==~==</l><l xml:id="m-88198ecf-2b4f-49cf-ad01-ce84d5bbb7e0" facs="#m-9c682b39-435f-4ebe-ae4c-fdb174877ad6" label="text-like">FEASTS OF APRIL.</l><l xml:id="m-86260850-d01e-4328-87cc-e93fa2b561ae" facs="#m-09e0040e-63ca-43ef-8ee6-843dcd13f42a" label="text-like">St. Francis of Paula, Confessor.</l><l xml:id="m-f88b83ac-1585-4b92-905e-c3f98e5fcfbb" facs="#m-9f989ae3-3205-433b-a5c5-91bc6f267f94" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-3d92a295-1938-4ceb-acd1-a7873fffed46" facs="#m-f95221ce-47ad-4a55-88c8-df1f09496ff7" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-cf936fcd-ae13-4e77-baaa-9fbb16677e21" facs="#m-919c5cd2-7126-4835-95a2-3ad83dd91ebb" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Jústus ut pálma. from the Common of a Confessor not a Bishop.</l><l xml:id="m-8869e4a5-2fbb-4606-a5b9-b217ff85393a" facs="#m-1dda1c9d-d676-4903-9799-a25612c853cf" label="text-like">.1204, except the following:</l><l xml:id="m-f31d5a4a-2906-4b53-b1f4-5a9380065b28" facs="#m-b80e1e5e-2268-4a57-acb4-f3f767c65cbf" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-2cc17d9f-db43-4e33-b5ab-ec8149cc2ac5" facs="#m-7a26ea16-bc72-4bfc-b4be-f230361a2466" label="lyrics-like">Eus, humilium celsitúdo, qui l ejus méritis et imitatióne, *pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-fcb7f550-415e-4b4e-b1b1-0f86bcaceab8" facs="#m-40b39af5-e2e8-403c-8d3a-fa5f1f7cc2e0" label="lyrics-like">missa humilibus praémia feliciter</l><l xml:id="m-49a1c685-6139-4f39-a08f-42677fb5d651" facs="#m-2d1c38f6-e528-4ba5-bf8f-6de4982b09b6" label="lyrics-like">I beátum Franciscum Confessó¬</l><l xml:id="m-0694ca47-351d-4923-9efc-7e7303fe8b89" facs="#m-7e4538e5-5146-47b7-8598-3e2c31e82b1d" label="lyrics-like">rem, Sanctórum tuórum glória su- consequámur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-753dbd4e-469e-4074-a00f-9b2909959ad3" facs="#m-c784a87b-a2ff-490f-ae14-988881eceb7c" label="lyrics-like">blimásti: t tribue quaésumus; ut</l><l xml:id="m-7200f2a1-2d94-4728-b0cf-d325757360de" facs="#m-4c3f025f-6caf-41e8-be60-de8c189635cc" label="lyrics-like">Epistle. Quae mihi fuérunt lucra. p. 1329</l><l xml:id="m-27e144f9-89f6-456a-a6b9-728069415a4e" facs="#m-fb40116d-36a7-422a-8c6d-2869727553cf" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-c5b57239-1b9c-431a-82c4-007253c62fe0" facs="#m-dadf8987-62bb-4090-93f9-40e8ffde03de" label="lyrics-like">«Aec dona devótae plebis, Dó-I grata, nobisque salutária, te mise¬</l><l xml:id="m-0d1a1b0f-581c-42db-884a-923d516b58d6" facs="#m-03e22a9f-2e6e-4072-af62-6c85326e7ad1" label="lyrics-like">Et mine, quibus tua cumulámus</l><l xml:id="m-c1265cbe-7d17-4b5e-a6a5-84f8c46f9c44" facs="#m-7b721b08-be6b-42cf-bd6c-b0b30c95d948" label="lyrics-like">ránte, reddántur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-bf25aea7-9f53-47ea-937e-c3d86e0ea6a9" facs="#m-e6e61042-18f3-41d5-8960-5e0f9663f95e" label="lyrics-like">altária, beáti Francisci méritis tibi</l><l xml:id="m-7b7c82cc-4991-429a-a107-7b1a746342db" facs="#m-0c6d8042-265f-46e0-9db6-e28178577d0a" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-79a1b247-38c5-4c35-9753-cc6e8c0d6ea3" facs="#m-1e41ee8b-813f-412a-bc0c-7b4987824890" label="lyrics-like">YUmpta, Dómine, sacraménta lut et temporális vitae subsídia nobis</l><l xml:id="m-ad772d51-db65-4362-9cc9-cbc58fde8b40" facs="#m-d494bbab-b2cd-4b54-80ba-236e805719d9" label="lyrics-like">O caeléstia: beáto Francisco Con¬</l><l xml:id="m-eebcf49a-ffbb-43b0-94df-5b8a192802dd" facs="#m-a9564a50-7db7-4133-b86f-62b295cee290" label="lyrics-like">cónferant, et aetérnae. Per Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-3605c0e3-02c6-48e8-b412-357de87e98ff" facs="#m-30b11781-50b6-4e85-8003-5dd45a1ead0c" label="lyrics-like">fessóre tuo intercedénte, precámur; ] num nostrum.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>